"Iella-inwer was a knight ranked sixty-eighth, a dear friend of Jeneth, and Stuart's mother."
"Her skill was The Ensnarer of Minds, which builds mind snares that shelter minds."
"On a chaos-snared world she sheltered Jeneth's mind, and there Stuart was conceived."
"Believing her success a demon's trick, she raised Stuart in secret inside her own mind trap."
"Jeneth struck her down to free Stuart's mind; a vision of her lingers with Stuart."
"She once mentored Rel at the art'h house."
